Please review a proposed refactor in our iOS sync layer. I manage the database side, so my main concern is that sync does not create duplicate rows, lose records, or leave a partial batch. The app team only said to make sync cleaner and faster. I do not know whether offline edits must win, whether deletes are final, or what minimum iOS version remains supported. Identify these questions instead of silently choosing behavior.

